      en: ["The population of Koulikoro town was estimated at 48,000 in 2022.", "The market was officially recognized in 1885 under French colonial administration.", "Market days attract around 10,000 visitors each Tuesday and Friday.", "The market covers an area of 2.8 hectares, with 1.5 hectares under permanent roofing.", "Average daily trade volume on market days exceeds 120 metric tons of agricultural produce.", "The market's annual turnover is estimated at over 15 billion CFA francs."],
